00:41:20.951 --> 00:41:22.719
- Good job.
- Good job.

00:41:22.719 --> 00:41:26.168
But I have to give you the credit, Mona.

00:41:26.168 --> 00:41:30.205
It's as if you're running 10,000 restaurants.

00:41:30.205 --> 00:41:31.295
- Yeah.
- You can handle it.

00:41:31.295 --> 00:41:33.819
You know exactly what you're doing.

00:41:33.819 --> 00:41:34.926
Thank you, Mona.

00:41:34.926 --> 00:41:37.862
We are so blessed with your presence.

00:41:37.862 --> 00:41:41.299
Thank you. I absolutely enjoyed...

00:41:41.299 --> 00:41:42.306
your company.

00:41:42.306 --> 00:41:45.158
I had no idea you could cook.

00:41:45.158 --> 00:41:47.533
Ah, you... you can literally do everything.

00:41:47.533 --> 00:41:49.406
Ah, as for you... you're on your own.

00:41:50.363 --> 00:41:52.621
- Hey, I also need affirmation.
- Love you!

00:41:52.621 --> 00:41:56.169
- Love you, Chef! Cheers!
- Just this one.

00:41:56.169 --> 00:41:59.139
I was struggling, we're struggling together.
But we made it through!

00:41:59.139 --> 00:42:01.498
Chef J, congratulations.

00:42:01.498 --> 00:42:05.490
What you're doing in the kitchen
is definitely not a simple task.

00:42:05.490 --> 00:42:06.919
You did a great job.

00:42:06.919 --> 00:42:08.688
Thank you.

00:42:08.688 --> 00:42:11.329
