"No, no, no, let me figure it out."

00:42:20.755 --> 00:42:23.864
And then you're like, "I got this.
I have nothing to do anyways."

00:42:23.864 --> 00:42:25.521
You're like, you have that attitude.

00:42:25.521 --> 00:42:29.143
