Chef, there's a mosquito!

00:42:36.582 --> 00:42:39.485
Right when I'm about to cry...

00:42:39.485 --> 00:42:42.025
Chef, there's a mosquito!

00:42:42.755 --> 00:42:45.686
Right when I'm about to cry...

00:42:45.686 --> 00:42:48.538
