- Oh my God.

00:42:48.538 --> 00:42:50.513
Mona!

00:42:50.513 --> 00:42:53.015
- Did you kill it?
- I can't...

00:42:53.744 --> 00:42:56.707
You're driving me crazy!

00:43:02.391 --> 00:43:04.282
Oh, my makeup...

00:43:04.282 --> 00:43:07.219
- Cheers, big ears!
- Cheers!

00:43:07.219 --> 00:43:08.475
Sorry, Chef.

00:43:08.475 --> 00:43:12.450
He might've gotten bitten, so I had to...

00:43:13.714 --> 00:43:15.415
Let's get a good rest.

00:43:15.415 --> 00:43:17.923
Let's end the night with a positive note.

00:43:17.923 --> 00:43:20.470
Everything is going to be fine.

00:43:20.470 --> 00:43:23.800
Everything is going to be fine.

00:43:27.236 --> 00:43:32.037
