00:43:33.734 --> 00:43:36.653
- We're so glad you're back.
- Yes!

00:43:36.653 --> 00:43:38.889
- Welcome back, Francine!
- I tried to...

00:43:38.889 --> 00:43:41.091
save up my energy. Ay, sorry.

00:43:41.091 --> 00:43:42.542
I'm glad you're better.

00:43:42.542 --> 00:43:45.000
- I'm here. I'm back, guys.
- Happy.

00:43:45.000 --> 00:43:46.552
I'll make it up to you guys.

00:43:46.552 --> 00:43:48.959
