- Hello!

00:43:54.198 --> 00:43:56.150
- Oh my God.
- Nice to meet you.

00:43:56.150 --> 00:43:57.379
Welcome, everyone!

00:43:57.379 --> 00:43:59.336
- Hello!
- Come on in!

00:43:59.336 --> 00:44:03.741
